    "「模型」页内置了 14 个可以直接下载的模型，带 ⭐ 的是推荐入门款。" to "The \"Model\" page comes with 14 models you can download directly; the ones marked with ⭐ are the recommended starter picks.",
    "名字里的数字越小（0.8B、1.5B）越快越省内存、但更笨；越大（7B、8B）越聪明、但更慢更占内存。新手建议从 2B / 4B 开始。" to "The smaller the number in the name (0.8B, 1.5B), the faster and more memory-efficient it is, but the less capable; the larger it is (7B, 8B), the smarter it is, but the slower and more memory-hungry. Beginners should start with 2B / 4B.",
    "怎么选" to "How to choose",
    "名字带 DeepSeek-R1 的模型会先「想一想」再回答，配合聊天页 🧠 深度思考开关能看到思考过程。" to "Models with DeepSeek-R1 in the name \"think it over\" before answering; together with the 🧠 Deep thinking toggle on the chat page you can see the reasoning process.",
    "会思考的模型" to "Thinking models",
    "本地模型暂不支持识别图片；模型文件几百 MB 到几 GB，建议用 Wi-Fi 下载。" to "Local models do not support image recognition yet; model files range from several hundred MB to several GB, so downloading over Wi-Fi is recommended.",
    "MNN 格式共 14 个：Qwen 系列（0.8B~35B）、DeepSeek-R1 蒸馏系、Llama、Gemma 等；「模型」页可刷新拉取列表。" to "There are 14 MNN-format models: the Qwen series (0.8B~35B), DeepSeek-R1 distillations, Llama, Gemma, and more; you can refresh the \"Model\" page to pull the list.",
    "模型卡显示名称 / 推荐星标 / 体积 / 版本号；下载完成后才可「切换使用」。" to "The model card shows the name / recommendation star / size / version number; \"Switch to this model\" becomes available only after the download finishes.",
    "版本标识" to "Version markers",
    "下载与断点续传" to "Download and resume",
    "继续" to "Continue",
    "下载失败" to "Download failed",
    "重试" to "Retry",
    "下载" to "Download",
    "断点续传" to "Resume download",
    "暂停" to "Pause",
    "点模型卡的「下载」开始下载，进度条实时显示；中途可暂停，下次接着下，不会从头再来。" to "Tap \"Download\" on the model card to start; the progress bar updates in real time. You can pause midway and pick it up next time without starting over.",
    "网络波动导致失败时会出现「重试」按钮，点击继续即可，已下载的部分不会浪费。" to "When a failure is caused by network fluctuation, a \"Retry\" button appears; just tap it to continue, and the part already downloaded is not wasted.",
    "失败怎么办" to "What if it fails",
    "模型托管在公共源，高峰期偏慢属正常；换 Wi-Fi 或错峰再试。" to "Models are hosted on public sources, so slower speeds during peak hours are normal; switch to Wi-Fi or try again off-peak.",
    "下载太慢" to "Download is too slow",
    "分块下载 + 断点续传；完成后做完整性校验；各失败阶段给出对应重试入口。模型文件不占用「存储管理」统计口径（后者仅业务数据）。" to "Chunked download + resume; an integrity check runs after completion; each failure stage offers its own retry entry point. Model files are not counted in \"Storage\" statistics (which cover business data only).",
    "加载与切换使用" to "Loading and switching",
    "换模型" to "Switch models",
    "首次加载" to "First load",
    "很慢" to "Very slow",
    "加载" to "Loading",
    "切换使用" to "Switch to this model",
    "删除模型" to "Delete model",
    "下载完成后点「切换使用」即装载该模型；回聊天页把顶部切到「📱 本地」就开始离线对话。" to "After the download finishes, tap \"Switch to this model\" to load it; go back to the chat page and set the top switch to \"📱 Local\" to start an offline conversation.",
    "再下载另一个模型点「切换使用」即可换人；不用的模型点「删除」清出空间。" to "Download another model and tap \"Switch to this model\" to swap it in; tap \"Delete\" on models you no longer use to free up space.",
    "首次加载大模型要等一会（手机正在把它读进内存）；内存紧张的手机加载大模型可能失败，换小一号的模型即可。" to "The first load of a large model takes a while (the phone is reading it into memory); on phones short on memory it may fail, so just switch to a model one size smaller.",
    "切换写入 active model 标记；switchProvider(LOCAL) 时按推理引擎设置快照加载；生成期间有前台保活通知。" to "Switching writes the active model marker; on switchProvider(LOCAL) the model is loaded from the inference engine settings snapshot; a foreground keep-alive notification is shown during generation.",
    "内存占用怎么看" to "How to check memory usage",
    "爆内存" to "Out of memory",
    "估算" to "Estimate",
    "多大内存" to "How much memory",
    "内存" to "Memory",
    "占用" to "Usage",
    "想知道一个模型要吃多少内存？到 设置 → 推理引擎设置 里拖动「上下文长度」，页面会实时显示内存估算，照着留余量即可。" to "Want to know how much memory a model will eat? Go to Settings → Inference engine settings and drag \"Context length\"; the page shows a live memory estimate, so just leave that much headroom.",
    "大约等于：模型体积 + 几百 MB 到 1GB 的额外开销。手机剩余可用内存比这个数大就基本稳。" to "Roughly: model size + a few hundred MB to 1 GB of extra overhead. If your phone's remaining available memory is larger than that, you are basically safe.",
    "一句话原则" to "Rule of thumb",
    "加载时闪退或报错多半是内存不足——换更小的模型，或调小上下文长度。" to "If the app crashes or throws an error while loading, it is usually a lack of memory — switch to a smaller model or reduce the context length.",
    "KV cache 按 fp16（2 字节/元素）估算：bytes = contextTokens × layerCount × 2 × kvHeads × headDim × bytesPerElement（GQA 按 numKeyValueHeads 折减，维度未知回退 full-hidden 近似与保守密度兜底）。实现在 LlmMemoryEstimator。" to "KV cache is estimated in fp16 (2 bytes/element): bytes = contextTokens × layerCount × 2 × kvHeads × headDim × bytesPerElement (GQA is reduced by numKeyValueHeads; when dimensions are unknown it falls back to the full-hidden approximation with a conservative density). Implemented in LlmMemoryEstimator.",
    "四种推理后端（AUTO/CPU/GPU/NPU）" to "Four inference backends (AUTO/CPU/GPU/NPU)",
    "骁龙" to "Snapdragon",
    "后端" to "Backend",
    "本地推理可以选择让手机哪个部件干活：自动（推荐）/ 强制 CPU / 强制 GPU / 强制 NPU。不了解就保持「自动」。" to "Local inference lets you choose which part of the phone does the work: Auto (recommended) / Force CPU / Force GPU / Force NPU. If you are unsure, leave it on \"Auto\".",
    "优先尝试 GPU 提速，条件不满足就退回 CPU 保证可用，全程无需操心。" to "It tries GPU acceleration first and falls back to CPU when the conditions are not met to keep things usable, with no effort required on your part.",
    "自动是什么" to "What is Auto",
    "手机里专门跑 AI 的芯片单元（通常是较新的骁龙机型才有）。强制 NPU 需要解锁设备驱动，属于高级玩法。" to "A chip unit inside the phone dedicated to running AI (usually only found on newer Snapdragon models). Forcing the NPU requires unlocking the device driver, which is advanced territory.",
    "NPU 是什么" to "What is NPU",
    "改完设置不用重启应用——下次发送消息时自动重载生效。" to "After changing settings you do not need to restart the app — it reloads automatically the next time you send a message.",
    "AUTO 仅对总参数量严格 >7B 的模型探测/启用 GPU（小模型不为注定 CPU 的推理等待探测）；OpenCL GPU 走健康探测与冷却机制（BackendHealthCoordinator 维护健康记录，异常后端移出回退链）；QNN NPU 基于 Hexagon（需骁龙 + 解锁）。完整回退链预览见推理引擎设置页底部说明区。" to "AUTO probes for and enables the GPU only for models with strictly >7B total parameters (small models are not made to wait for probing when they are destined for CPU); OpenCL GPU uses a health probe and cooldown mechanism (BackendHealthCoordinator keeps health records, and unhealthy backends are removed from the fallback chain); QNN NPU is based on Hexagon (requires Snapdragon + unlocking). See the note area at the bottom of the inference engine settings page for a full fallback chain preview.",
    "性能模式与投机解码" to "Performance mode and speculative decoding",
    "加速" to "Acceleration",
    "平衡" to "Balanced",
    "跑分" to "Benchmark",
    "性能模式" to "Performance mode",
    "投机解码" to "Speculative decoding",
    "投机采样" to "Speculative sampling",
    "「推理性能模式」有两档：综合平衡（默认，推荐）与最高速度。日常用平衡即可，追求响应速度可切最高速度。" to "\"Inference performance mode\" has two levels: Balanced (default, recommended) and Maximum speed. Balanced is fine for everyday use; switch to Maximum speed if you want faster responses.",
    "「Lookahead 投机解码」是实验性加速开关：必须先用页面里的「运行基准并认证」跑完测试、且证明在你这台手机上确实更快之后，打开它才真正生效；否则即使打开也不会起作用。" to "\"Lookahead speculative decoding\" is an experimental acceleration switch: it only takes effect after you run the test with \"Run benchmark and certify\" on the page and it proves genuinely faster on your phone; otherwise turning it on does nothing.",
    "Profile resolver 统一裁决性能模式与候选加速项。Lookahead 仅当 device+model+CPU_OPTIMIZED 变体组合命中认证记录（InferenceCertificationStore）时启用；未认证候选恒回落 lookahead=false。" to "The profile resolver is the single authority for performance mode and candidate acceleration items. Lookahead is enabled only when the device+model+CPU_OPTIMIZED variant combination hits a certification record (InferenceCertificationStore); uncertified candidates always fall back to lookahead=false.",
    "「运行基准并认证」跑 FIXED_DECODE 对比（预热轮 + 记录轮）→ 判定 promotion → 认证落盘后旧开关才被放行。" to "\"Run benchmark and certify\" runs a FIXED_DECODE comparison (warm-up rounds + recorded rounds) → decides promotion → the old switch is only allowed once the certification is written to disk.",
    "基准闭环" to "Benchmark closed loop",
    "CPU 线程数与上下文长度" to "CPU thread count and context length",
    "参数" to "Parameters",
    "生成长度" to "Generation length",
    "线程" to "Threads",
    "记忆长度" to "Context length",
    "这两项决定本地 AI「算得多快」与「记性多好」。默认值已经比较合理，不确定就别动。" to "These two determine how fast the local AI \"computes\" and how good its \"memory\" is. The defaults are already reasonable, so leave them alone if you are unsure.",
    "一般设成手机的大核数量（常见为 4）即可，盲目调大反而发热降频变慢。" to "Usually just set it to the number of big cores on your phone (commonly 4); raising it blindly only causes heat, throttling and slower speed.",
    "线程数" to "Threads",
    "相当于 AI 的短期记忆容量，范围 512–8192；调大记得住更多对话但更吃内存。" to "This is the AI's short-term memory capacity, ranging from 512–8192; a larger value remembers more conversation but uses more memory.",
    "单次回复的字数上限，可在设置页调整。" to "The maximum length of a single reply, adjustable on the Settings page.",
    "修改后下次发消息时自动重载生效，页面顶部会显示提示横幅。" to "After a change, the model reloads automatically on your next message, and a banner appears at the top of the page.",
    "默认 contextLen=4096 / threads=4 / temperature=0.8（AppConfig.LLM）。KV cache 随 contextLen 线性增长（见「内存占用怎么看」）；llm_config_changed 横幅提示重载，成功推理后 acknowledge 写回 last_applied 快照消除横幅。" to "Defaults are contextLen=4096 / threads=4 / temperature=0.8 (AppConfig.LLM). KV cache grows linearly with contextLen (see \"How to read memory usage\"); the llm_config_changed banner indicates a reload, and after a successful inference acknowledge writes back the last_applied snapshot to clear the banner.",
    "gpu慢" to "GPU is slow",
    "第一次慢" to "Slow the first time",
    "首字延迟" to "First-token latency",
    "用 GPU 时是不是感觉第一句话特别慢？到 推理引擎设置 里手动点一次「GPU 完整预热」，之后首次回复会明显变快。" to "When using the GPU, does the first sentence feel especially slow? Go to Inference engine settings and tap \"GPU full preheat\" once manually; the first reply will be noticeably faster afterwards.",
    "只有大于 7B 的大模型才需要预热（小模型按钮不可用）；预热过程手机发热几分钟属正常现象。" to "Only large models above 7B need preheating (the button is unavailable for small models); the phone heating up for a few minutes during preheating is normal.",
    "GpuPreheatCoordinator 手动触发（空闲期策略只做轻量 OpenCL 探测、绝不自动加载模型）：加载当前 >7B 模型执行一次极短 GPU 生成，预热 OpenCL 图/内核/缓存，降低首字延迟（TTFT）；预热后无条件释放，不影响聊天记录与已保存设置。" to "GpuPreheatCoordinator is triggered manually (the idle-period policy only does a lightweight OpenCL probe and never loads the model automatically): it loads the current >7B model to run one extremely short GPU generation, preheating the OpenCL graph/kernels/cache and reducing first-token latency (TTFT); the model is unconditionally released afterwards, with no effect on chat history or saved settings.",
    "性能浮窗" to "Performance overlay",
    "温度" to "Temperature",
    "监控" to "Monitoring",
    "速率" to "Rate",
    "浮窗" to "Overlay",
    "性能" to "Performance",
    "本地模式下聊天页有一个小浮窗，实时显示 AI 出字速度、手机温度、内存占用等信息。纯展示、不影响聊天，可以拖到顺手的位置。" to "In local mode the chat page has a small overlay that shows the AI's output speed, phone temperature, memory usage and more in real time. It is display-only, does not affect chatting, and can be dragged to a convenient position.",
    "设置里的「性能浮窗液态玻璃」开关：开=模糊玻璃质感（Android 12+），关=普通深色面板。老手机建议关。" to "The \"Performance overlay liquid glass\" switch in Settings: on = frosted glass look (Android 12+), off = a plain dark panel. Turning it off is recommended on older phones.",
    "外观切换" to "Appearance switching",
    "PerformanceCollector 500ms 周期采集：token 速率、CPU 大核频率、GPU/NPU 状态、温度、内存等指标；液态玻璃渲染走 RenderEffect 模糊路径，关闭后为纯色面板。" to "PerformanceCollector samples every 500ms: token rate, CPU big-core frequency, GPU/NPU status, temperature, memory and other metrics; liquid glass rendering uses the RenderEffect blur path, and when disabled it becomes a solid-color panel.",
    "会话管理" to "Conversation management",
    "多个会话" to "Multiple conversations",
    "删除消息" to "Delete message",
    "会话" to "Conversation",
    "和每个角色的聊天都可以开多个「会话」，就像同一个人有多个聊天窗口。点聊天顶部的 💬 图标打开会话抽屉。" to "You can open multiple \"conversations\" with each character, like having several chat windows with the same person. Tap the 💬 icon at the top of the chat to open the conversation drawer.",
    "抽屉里「新建对话」开新话题；点任意历史会话即可切回去，记录都在。" to "\"New conversation\" in the drawer starts a new topic; tap any past conversation to switch back — the records are all there.",
    "新建 / 切换" to "New / Switch",
    "会话可以重命名、删除；单条消息也能删除。导出见「对话导出」篇。" to "Conversations can be renamed or deleted, and individual messages can also be deleted. For export, see the \"Conversation export\" article.",
    "整理" to "Organization",
    "会话按角色隔离（active_conversations 映射当前会话）；单会话历史上限按配置修剪最旧；PromptWindowPlanner 在候选内保 system + 最近完整轮次。" to "Conversations are isolated per character (active_conversations maps the current conversation); the per-conversation history limit trims the oldest entries according to configuration; PromptWindowPlanner keeps system plus the most recent complete rounds within the candidates.",
    "对话导出（TXT / 图片）" to "Conversation export (TXT / Image)",
    "长图" to "Long image",
    "保存聊天" to "Save chat",
    "截图" to "Screenshot",
    "导出" to "Export",
    "备份" to "Backup",
    "想把聊天记录保存或分享？打开会话抽屉 →「导出记录」→ 选格式：" to "Want to save or share your chat history? Open the conversation drawer → \"Export records\" → choose a format:",
    "完整文字记录，方便备份与搜索。" to "A complete text transcript, convenient for backup and search.",
    "把聊天渲染成漂亮的对话截图：超长会话自动分页多张图，短会话可拼一张长图。" to "Renders the chat into attractive conversation screenshots: very long conversations are automatically split into multiple pages, while short ones can be combined into a single long image.",
    "图片" to "Image",
    "conversationexport 管线：ConversationTextExporter 全量 TXT / ConversationImageRenderer 分页渲染 PNG（Canvas 绘制，超限自动分页防 OOM）。" to "The conversationexport pipeline: ConversationTextExporter produces a full TXT / ConversationImageRenderer renders paged PNGs (Canvas drawing, automatically paginating when the limit is exceeded to prevent OOM).",
    "深度思考开关" to "Deep thinking switch",
    "思维链" to "Chain of thought",
    "推理" to "Reasoning",
    "思考" to "Thinking",
    "点聊天顶部 🧠 图标开启「深度思考」：AI 回答前会先展示一段「思考过程」，然后再给正式答案；思考段自动折叠，点一下可展开查看。" to "Tap the 🧠 icon at the top of the chat to turn on \"Deep thinking\": before answering, the AI first shows a \"thinking process\" and then gives the final answer; the thinking section is collapsed automatically and can be expanded with a tap.",
    "数学、逻辑、复杂问题更适合；日常闲聊关掉回复更快。开了也没关系——「自动」档位遇到简单问题会自动跳过思考。" to "It suits math, logic and complex questions; for everyday small talk, turning it off gives faster replies. Leaving it on is fine too — the \"Auto\" level automatically skips thinking for simple questions.",
    "什么时候开" to "When to turn it on",
    "不是所有模型都会思考：免费的 DeepSeek-R1-7B、云端的 Qwen / DeepSeek 系列支持较好。" to "Not all models can think: the free DeepSeek-R1-7B and the cloud Qwen / DeepSeek series support it well.",
    "云端解析 delta.reasoning_content / reasoning 字段包装 <think> 流式段；本地 MNN enable_thinking 且受 LocalThinkingLevel 档位（AUTO/短/中/长）控制。AUTO 走 when-to-think 路由：平凡/简单输入整轮跳过思考，STANDARD→短档、COMPLEX→中档；软提示为「思考模板」微指令 + 思考段字节硬预算截断收束。" to "The cloud path parses the delta.reasoning_content / reasoning fields to wrap a <think> streaming segment; locally MNN enable_thinking applies and is controlled by the LocalThinkingLevel level (AUTO/Short/Medium/Long). AUTO goes through when-to-think routing: trivial/simple input skips thinking for the whole round, STANDARD→short level, COMPLEX→medium level; the soft prompt is a \"thinking template\" micro-instruction plus a hard byte budget truncation to bound the thinking segment.",
    "上传图片对话" to "Upload images for chat",
    "多模态" to "Multimodal",
    "识图" to "Image recognition",
    "拍照" to "Take photo",
    "发图" to "Send image",
    "看图" to "View image",
    "聊天输入框点 ➕ 可以添加图片（一次最多 3 张），让 AI「看图说话」。" to "Tap ➕ in the chat input box to add images (up to 3 at a time) and let the AI \"talk about what it sees\".",
    "需要支持看图的模型：云端多模态模型可以；免费通道与本地模型目前看不了图片。" to "A model that supports images is required: cloud multimodal models work; the free channel and local models cannot view images for now.",
    "图片 base64 进 vision content parts；能否携带由活跃模型的模态能力决定，本地 MNN 无 vision。输入栏预览可逐张移除。" to "Images enter vision content parts as base64; whether they can be attached depends on the active model's modality capability, and local MNN has no vision. Previews in the input bar can be removed one by one.",
    "PDF 与文本文件" to "PDF and text files",
    "上传文件" to "Upload file",
    "附件" to "Attachment",
    "文件" to "File",
    "文档" to "Document",
    "输入框 📎 可以发文件给 AI 读：PDF 自动提取文字（前 6 页），txt / md 等纯文本直接读取。" to "The 📎 button in the input box can send files for the AI to read: PDF text is extracted automatically (first 6 pages), and plain text such as txt / md is read directly.",
    "Word / PPT 等 Office 文档请先转成 PDF 再发；PDF 超长时只读前 6 页。" to "Convert Word / PPT and other Office documents to PDF before sending; when a PDF is very long, only the first 6 pages are read.",
    "逐页渲染提取（页数上限），base64 流式编码防大文件 OOM；Office 族不受支持需预转 PDF。" to "Page-by-page rendering extraction (with a page cap); base64 streaming encoding prevents OOM on large files. Office formats are unsupported and must be converted to PDF beforehand.",
    "代码高亮与数学公式" to "Code highlighting and math formulas",
    "高亮" to "Highlight",
    "代码块" to "Code block",
    "复制代码" to "Copy code",
    "代码" to "Code",
    "公式" to "Formula",
    "数学" to "Math",
    "AI 回复里的代码会自动变成彩色代码块（可一键复制，超长自动折叠）；数学公式也会正确排版显示。" to "Code in AI replies automatically becomes a colored code block (copyable with one tap, auto-collapsed when very long); math formulas are also rendered with correct layout.",
    "让 AI 用一对符号把公式包起来即可：行内公式用单个美元符包裹、独立公式块用双美元符包裹（例如「请用 LaTeX 输出这段公式的行内形式」）。" to "Just have the AI wrap the formula in a pair of symbols: use a single dollar sign for an inline formula and double dollar signs for a standalone formula block (for example, \"please output this formula in inline LaTeX form\").",
    "公式怎么写" to "How to write formulas",
    "代码块语法高亮 + 复制；LaTeX 渲染行内 $...$ 与块级 $$...$$（上下标/分数/根号常用子集）。" to "Syntax highlighting and copy for code blocks; LaTeX renders inline \$...\$ and block-level \$\$...\$\$ (a common subset of sub/superscripts, fractions, and radicals).",
    "开通语音朗读（两种方式）" to "Enable read aloud (two ways)",
    "配音" to "Voiceover",
    "声音" to "Voice",
    "念出来" to "Read aloud",
    "语音合成" to "TTS",
    "豆包" to "Doubao",
    "火山" to "Volcano Engine",
    "想让角色开口说话？两种方式任选：" to "Want your characters to speak out loud? Choose either of two ways:",
    "方式一：手机自带语音（零成本，推荐先试）" to "Option 1: your phone's built-in speech (zero cost, try this first)",
    "设置 → 语音合成(TTS) → 朗读引擎选「手机系统语音」→ 挑个声音模板 → 保存。离线免费，立刻能用。" to "Settings → TTS → choose \"Phone system speech\" as the read-aloud engine → pick a voice template → Save. Offline and free, works right away.",
    "方式二：云端火山豆包（更自然好听）" to "Option 2: cloud Volcano Doubao (more natural and pleasant)",
    "注册火山引擎 → 开通「语音合成」服务拿 API Key → 设置里朗读引擎选「云端（火山豆包）」→ 粘贴 Key → 保存。" to "Register with Volcano Engine → activate the \"TTS\" service to get an API Key → in Settings choose \"Cloud (Volcano Doubao)\" as the read-aloud engine → paste the Key → Save.",
    "设置里有「试听」按钮，配好后点一下就知道效果。" to "Settings has a \"Preview\" button; tap it once configured to hear the result.",
    "先试听" to "Preview first",
    "云端直连火山 openspeech V3 unidirectional chunked 端点（X-Api-Key 鉴权）；声音复刻资源 seed-icl-2.0 已预置，无需 AppID / AccessKey / ResourceID。系统引擎经 TextToSpeech 模板匹配、无匹配语音回落默认（语速音调仍生效）。" to "The cloud option connects directly to the Volcano openspeech V3 unidirectional chunked endpoint (X-Api-Key authentication); the voice cloning resource seed-icl-2.0 is preset, so AppID / AccessKey / ResourceID are not needed. The system engine uses TextToSpeech template matching and falls back to the default voice when nothing matches (speech rate and pitch still apply).",
    "声音复刻与角色音色映射" to "Voice cloning and character voice mapping",
    "角色声音" to "Character voice",
    "专属声音" to "Exclusive voice",
    "克隆" to "Clone",
    "音色" to "Voice",
    "复刻" to "Cloning",
    "想让每个角色用自己的专属声音说话？在火山引擎「声音复刻」用一段录音训练出音色，会得到一串 S_xxx 编号，回来填给对应角色即可。" to "Want every character to speak with its own exclusive voice? Train a voice in Volcano Engine's \"Voice cloning\" with a recording, and you get an S_xxx ID; come back and assign it to the matching character.",
    "配置位置" to "Where to set it",
    "设置 → 角色双语音色（speaker_id）：每个角色有中文、日文两格；没填的角色使用上方「默认音色」。" to "Settings → Character bilingual voices (speaker_id): each character has two fields, Chinese and Japanese; characters left blank use the \"Default voice\" above.",
    "想让角色说日语，需要为她填日文音色；只填中文音色时日语朗读会退回默认音色。" to "To have a character speak Japanese, fill in a Japanese voice for her; if only a Chinese voice is set, Japanese read-aloud falls back to the default voice.",
    "日语注意" to "Note for Japanese",
    "VoicePair(zh/ja speaker_id) 按角色映射；解析顺序：角色当前语言 speaker_id → TtsConfig.defaultVoiceId；JA 缺失同样回落默认。试听按当前引擎与语言取样。" to "VoicePair(zh/ja speaker_id) maps per character; resolution order: the speaker_id for the character's current language → TtsConfig.defaultVoiceId; a missing JA voice likewise falls back to the default. Preview samples with the current engine and language.",
    "中日双语模式" to "Chinese-Japanese bilingual mode",
    "双语" to "Bilingual",
    "字幕" to "Subtitles",
    "日语" to "Japanese",
    "语言切换" to "Language switching",
    "聊天顶部有个圆形语言按钮（中 / 日），点一下切换。日语模式下角色会用日语回复并朗读，屏幕底部还显示中日对照字幕，方便一边看翻译一边听。" to "There is a round language button (ZH / JA) at the top of the chat; tap it to switch. In Japanese mode, characters reply and read aloud in Japanese, and bilingual Chinese-Japanese subtitles appear at the bottom of the screen so you can read the translation while listening.",
    "日语模式需要云端 AI；本地模型说不好日语。" to "Japanese mode requires a cloud AI; local models do not speak Japanese well.",
    "JA 模式：正文生成后经 chatOnce 非流式翻译再合成；字幕条同步展示原文与译文。语言选择全局持久化。" to "JA mode: after the body text is generated, it is translated non-streaming via chatOnce and then synthesized; the subtitle bar shows the original and the translation side by side. The language choice is persisted globally.",
    "自动朗读与音量" to "Auto read aloud and volume",
    "离线朗读" to "Offline read aloud",
    "音量" to "Volume",
    "自动朗读" to "Auto read aloud",
    "系统语音" to "System speech",
    "「自动朗读新回复」打开后（设置 → 语音合成），AI 每次回复完成自动读出来，不用再手动点 ▶；仍可随时点消息旁的朗读按钮手动控制。" to "Once \"Auto read new replies\" is on (Settings → TTS), every AI reply is read aloud automatically when it finishes, so you no longer need to tap ▶ manually; you can still tap the read-aloud button next to a message at any time for manual control.",
    "朗读音量跟随手机媒体音量，用侧面音量键调节即可。" to "Read-aloud volume follows the phone's media volume; just adjust it with the side volume keys.",
    "朗读中再点一次 ▶ 即停止；开始播放视频时会自动暂停朗读避免抢声。" to "Tapping ▶ again during read-aloud stops it; starting video playback automatically pauses read-aloud to avoid overlapping audio.",
    "停止朗读" to "Stop read aloud",
    "tts_auto_read 持久化开关；播放器队列化 utterance，Seedance 播放控制器抢占时挂起当前朗读。" to "The tts_auto_read persisted toggle; the player queues utterances, and the current read-aloud is suspended when the Seedance playback controller preempts it.",
    "世界观设定（绑定注入）" to "Worldview settings (bound injection)",
    "背景设定" to "Background setting",
    "人际设定" to "Relationship setting",
    "世界观" to "Worldview",
    "设定注入" to "Setting injection",
    "「世界观」是你写给 AI 看的背景设定，比如「这个故事发生在魔法学院」「我和她是同学」。每条设定只对你指定的那个聊天生效。" to "\"Worldview\" is the background setting you write for the AI to read, for example \"this story takes place at a magic academy\" or \"she and I are classmates\". Each setting only applies to the chat you specify.",
    "怎么建" to "How to create one",
    "设置 → 世界观设定 → 添加：起名、写正文、选择给谁用（某角色的私聊或某群）→ 保存。" to "Settings → Worldview → Add: give it a name, write the body, choose who it applies to (a character's private chat or a group) → Save.",
    "同一个聊天可以添加多条世界观，按顺序依次生效。" to "You can add multiple worldviews to the same chat; they take effect one after another in order.",
    "多条叠加" to "Stacking multiple entries",
    "WorldviewConfig 一一绑定目标（CHARACTER / GROUP + targetId），buildWorldviewDirective 注入 system prompt；同目标多条按序拼接。目标悬空显式告警，不静默丢弃。" to "WorldviewConfig binds one-to-one to a target (CHARACTER / GROUP + targetId), and buildWorldviewDirective injects it into the system prompt; multiple entries for the same target are concatenated in order. A dangling target raises an explicit warning and is never silently dropped.",
    "世界书是什么 & 导入导出" to "What a lorebook is & import/export",
    "导入json" to "Import JSON",
    "st导入" to "ST import",
    "酒馆" to "SillyTavern",
    "「世界书」是一堆背景资料的合集：平时藏着不占地方，一旦聊天里提到相关关键词，对应资料才被塞给 AI 参考。适合存放大量世界观细节。" to "A \"lorebook\" is a collection of background material: it normally stays hidden and takes up no room, and only when a related keyword comes up in the chat is the matching material injected for the AI to reference. It is ideal for storing large amounts of worldview detail.",
    "导入现成的" to "Import a ready-made one",
    "设置 → 世界书 → 「导入 .json」：SillyTavern（酒馆）格式的世界书文件直接兼容。" to "Settings → Lorebook → \"Import .json\": SillyTavern lorebook files are directly compatible.",
    "自己建" to "Build your own",
    "「新建」命名一本书 → 点进去 → 「添加条目」写关键词与内容；每本书、每条目都有独立开关。" to "Tap \"New\" and name a book → enter it → tap \"Add entry\" to write keywords and content; every book and every entry has its own toggle.",
    "书详情页可导出 SillyTavern 兼容 JSON，和酒馆玩家互通。" to "The book detail page can export SillyTavern-compatible JSON, so you can share with SillyTavern users.",
    "导出分享" to "Export & share",
    "LorebookJson 双向 ST 兼容；ST 格式不含本应用的绑定路由，导入一律落 ALL 作用域。书级 scopeType（ALL / CHARACTER / GROUP + scopeIds）决定参与哪些聊天匹配（matchesScope）。" to "LorebookJson is bidirectionally ST-compatible; the ST format does not carry this app's binding routes, so imports always land in the ALL scope. The book-level scopeType (ALL / CHARACTER / GROUP + scopeIds) decides which chats participate in matching (matchesScope).",
    "关键词触发与次级关键词" to "Keyword triggering and secondary keywords",
    "绿灯" to "Green light",
    "扫描" to "Scan",
    "匹配" to "Match",
    "关键词" to "Keyword",
    "触发" to "Trigger",
    "次级关键词" to "Secondary keyword",
    "每个条目写几个「主关键词」（顿号或逗号隔开）：聊天最近几句里出现关键词，这条资料就被激活注入。" to "Write a few \"primary keywords\" for each entry (separated by commas or ideographic commas): when a keyword appears in the most recent few lines of the chat, this material is activated and injected.",
    "可选的进阶条件：要求「同时出现」「出现任意一个」「不全出现」「都不出现」等组合逻辑，精确控制生效时机。" to "Optional advanced conditions: require combinations such as \"all appear\", \"any one appears\", \"not all appear\", or \"none appear\" to precisely control when an entry takes effect.",
    "默认检查最近 2 条消息；可在 设置 → 世界书 → 全局参数 调大扫描深度。" to "By default the most recent 2 messages are checked; you can increase the scan depth in Settings → Lorebook → Global parameters.",
    "扫描范围" to "Scan range",
    "LorebookEntry.keys 主匹配 + secondaryKeys 五种 LorebookSecondaryLogic 组合语义；scanDepth 全局默认 2、条目 scanDepthOverride 可覆盖（≤0 视为继承）；caseSensitive / matchWholeWords 精细控制匹配行为。" to "LorebookEntry.keys primary matching plus the five LorebookSecondaryLogic combination semantics of secondaryKeys; scanDepth defaults globally to 2 and can be overridden per entry by scanDepthOverride (≤0 means inherit); caseSensitive / matchWholeWords finely control matching behavior.",
    "插入位置与常驻蓝灯" to "Insertion position and the always-on blue light",
    "插入位置" to "Insertion position",
    "深度" to "Depth",
    "顺序" to "Order",
    "蓝灯" to "Blue light",
    "常驻" to "Always on",
    "条目激活后插到哪里、对 AI 影响多强，都可以调：" to "Where an entry is inserted once activated, and how strongly it affects the AI, can both be adjusted:",
    "条目的「常驻条目」开关（酒馆里叫蓝灯）：打开后不再需要关键词，每次对话必定注入。核心世界观设定用它。" to "The entry's \"Constant entry\" toggle (called the blue light in SillyTavern): once enabled, no keyword is needed and it is injected on every conversation. Use it for core worldview settings.",
    "蓝灯 = 常驻" to "Blue light = always on",
    "可放在角色设定的前面 / 后面，或插进最近聊天记录中间的指定位置（@深度，数值越小越靠近最新消息、影响越强）。" to "It can be placed before / after the character settings, or inserted at a specified position in the middle of the recent chat history (@depth; the smaller the value, the closer to the newest message and the stronger the influence).",
    "order 数值越大排得越靠下、话语权越强；预算不够裁剪时也是高 order 优先保留。" to "The larger the order value, the lower it ranks and the stronger its say; when the budget is too small and trimming is needed, high order is also kept first.",
    "插入顺序" to "Insertion order",
    "LorebookInsertPosition：BEFORE_CHAR / AFTER_CHAR / AT_DEPTH(depth)；constant=true 免关键词必注入；order 控制装配次序与预算裁剪优先级；probability 1-100 触发概率门。" to "LorebookInsertPosition: BEFORE_CHAR / AFTER_CHAR / AT_DEPTH(depth); constant=true injects without needing keywords; order controls assembly order and budget-trimming priority; probability is a 1-100 trigger probability gate.",
    "Token 预算与递归扫描" to "Token budget and recursive scanning",
    "超预算" to "Over budget",
    "注入太多" to "Too much injected",
    "预算" to "Budget",
    "递归" to "Recursion",
    "设置 → 世界书 → 全局参数里有两个总闸：" to "Settings → Lorebook → Global parameters has two master switches:",
    "所有被激活条目的内容加起来最多塞多少给 AI（默认 1024），防止把对话撑爆。" to "The maximum total amount of all activated entries that can be fed to the AI (default 1024), to prevent blowing up the conversation.",
    "打开后，A 条目内容里出现的新关键词还能继续激活 B 条目（最多连环 3 层）。设定联动复杂时有用，一般保持关闭。" to "When enabled, new keywords appearing in entry A's content can further activate entry B (up to 3 chained layers). Useful when settings are complexly interlinked; normally keep it off.",
    "budgetCapTokens ≤0 视为不限——本地默认 context 4096 下危险，PromptWindowPlanner 有 SYSTEM_PROMPT_TOO_LARGE 兜底；recursiveScanning 最多 3 轮；条目级 preventRecursion / excludeRecursion 分别阻止自身外链扩散与被递归轮激活。" to "budgetCapTokens ≤0 is treated as unlimited—dangerous with the local default context of 4096, and PromptWindowPlanner has a SYSTEM_PROMPT_TOO_LARGE fallback; recursiveScanning runs at most 3 rounds; the per-entry preventRecursion / excludeRecursion respectively block outward chain spread from itself and activation by a recursive round.",
    "角色库与搜索" to "Character library and search",
    "角色搜索" to "Character search",
    "立绘" to "Illustration",
    "换角色" to "Switch character",
    "人设" to "Persona",
    "角色库" to "Character library",
    "应用内置大量预设角色，每人有独立性格、说话方式与立绘；也支持自建角色。「角色」页网格浏览，顶部搜索框支持按名称等条件查找。" to "The app includes many preset characters, each with their own personality, way of speaking, and illustration; you can also create your own. Browse them as a grid on the \"Characters\" page, and use the search box at the top to find them by name and other criteria.",
    "角色卡上的「查看人设」可阅读完整人格设定正文。" to "\"View persona\" on a character card lets you read the full personality setting text.",
    "查看人设" to "View persona",
    "角色页点任意角色卡片，即刻把她设为当前对象并直达聊天。" to "Tap any character card on the Characters page to immediately set her as the current partner and go straight to the chat.",
    "点谁聊谁" to "Tap to chat with anyone",
    "预设角色序列 + 自定义角色合并展示；filterCharacters 多字段 contains（忽略大小写）同函数复用于角色页与世界观点选器。" to "Preset character sequence + custom characters shown merged; filterCharacters multi-field contains (case-insensitive) is reused by both the Characters page and the worldview viewpoint selector.",
    "新建 / 导入自定义角色" to "Create / import a custom character",
    "导出角色" to "Export character",
    "角色卡" to "Character card",
    "做角色" to "Make a character",
    "自定义角色" to "Custom character",
    "新建角色" to "New character",
    "导入角色" to "Import character",
    "想聊自己创造的角色？角色页 →「新建」：起名、传一张立绘、写一段「人格设定」（她是谁、什么性格、怎么说话），保存后立刻出现在列表里。" to "Want to chat with a character you created yourself? Characters page → \"New\": give her a name, upload an illustration, write a \"personality setting\" (who she is, what her personality is like, how she speaks); once saved she appears in the list right away.",
    "「导出」把你做的角色复制成 JSON 发给别人；「导入」粘贴 JSON 收下对方的角色。" to "\"Export\" copies the character you made into JSON to send to others; \"Import\" pastes JSON to receive the other person's character.",
    "分享角色" to "Share a character",
    "自定义角色卡片上有编辑 / 删除按钮，随时调整人设。" to "Custom character cards have edit / delete buttons, so you can adjust the persona at any time.",
    "随时改" to "Edit anytime",
    "Character(systemPrompt 必填) JSON 序列化导入导出；自定义角色立绘经 CharacterImageStore 本地存储。" to "Character (systemPrompt required) is serialized to JSON for import/export; custom character illustrations are stored locally via CharacterImageStore.",
    "好感度 · 礼物 · 剧情事件" to "Affinity · Gifts · Story events",
    "羁绊" to "Bonds",
    "事件" to "Events",
    "解锁剧情" to "Unlock stories",
    "特殊邂逅" to "Special encounter",
    "好感度" to "Affinity",
    "关系" to "Relationships",
    "礼物墙" to "Gift wall",
    "送礼物、常聊天都能涨「好感度」（满值 200）。好感越高解锁越多：" to "Sending gifts and chatting often both raise \"Affinity\" (max 200). The higher the affinity, the more you unlock:",
    "角色页点好感进度进入档案页：进度条、收礼记录（礼物墙）、随好感解锁的剧情入口。" to "Tap the affinity progress on a character page to open their profile page: progress bar, gift records (gift wall), and story entries unlocked by affinity.",
    "关系档案" to "Relationship profile",
    "达到好感门槛解锁专属剧情对话，类似游戏里的个人线；自定义角色也可以自己编写各阶段剧情。" to "Reaching affinity thresholds unlocks exclusive story dialogues, similar to a character route in a game; custom characters can also have stories written for each stage.",
    "剧情事件" to "Story events",
    "设置 → 我的形象：上传你的头像、写下你是谁、与她什么关系——AI 在单聊、群聊、主动消息里都会记住这些设定。" to "Settings → My persona: upload your avatar, write down who you are and what relationship you have with her — the AI remembers these settings in single chats, group chats, and proactive messages.",
    "我的形象" to "My persona",
    "好感经济为 Room 体系（钱包 / 账本 / 礼物档案，MAX_AFFINITY=200）；AFFINITY_EVENT_THRESHOLDS 阈值解锁阶段事件，场景 prompt 开启事件会话（离线保底目录）；UserProfileConfig(persona/relationship/avatar) 注入三类会话上下文。" to "The affinity economy is a Room-based system (wallet / ledger / gift records, MAX_AFFINITY=200); AFFINITY_EVENT_THRESHOLDS unlocks stage events at thresholds, and the scene prompt opens event conversations (with an offline fallback catalog); UserProfileConfig(persona/relationship/avatar) is injected into the context of the three conversation types.",
    "通知" to "Notifications",
    "主动找你" to "Messages you proactively",
    "早安" to "Good morning",
    "主动问候" to "Proactive greetings",
    "主动消息" to "Proactive messages",
    "问候" to "Greetings",
    "想让角色主动来找你？设置 → 角色问候：打开开关、勾选哪些角色可以主动发消息、设定每天最多几条（默认 3 条）。之后白天时间里她们会像真人一样随机找你说话，并推送通知。" to "Want characters to come to you first? Settings → Character greetings: turn on the switch, select which characters may send proactive messages, and set the daily maximum (3 by default). Then during the daytime they will randomly start talking to you like real people and push notifications.",
    "点「测试主动问候（10 秒后）」马上体验一次，测试不计入每日条数。" to "Tap \"Test proactive greeting (after 10 seconds)\" to try it once right away; tests do not count toward the daily limit.",
    "先测试" to "Test first",
    "仅云端 AI 可用；需要允许通知权限，收不到时按页面提示去系统设置开启。" to "Available only with cloud AI; the notification permission must be allowed, and if you receive nothing, follow the page prompt to enable it in system settings.",
    "多数情况是国产手机杀了后台：按「后台保活三件套」篇设置一遍即可解决。" to "In most cases the Chinese phone has killed the background process: just go through the \"Background survival trio\" section once to fix it.",
    "收不到排查" to "Not receiving anything",
    "GreetingScheduler 15min PeriodicWork 心跳 + next_fire_at 门控 + 精确闹钟兜底 + BootReceiver 重挂；投递时段 08:00–23:00；每日配额默认 3（1–10）；多角色严格轮询（greeting_last_char_id 的下一个）；Android 14 生成期前台化通知；测试路径跳过门控不计配额。" to "GreetingScheduler 15min PeriodicWork heartbeat + next_fire_at gating + exact alarm fallback + BootReceiver re-registration; delivery window 08:00–23:00; daily quota 3 by default (1–10); strict rotation across characters (the next one after greeting_last_char_id); foregrounded notification during generation on Android 14; the test path skips gating and does not count against the quota.",
    "后台保活三件套" to "Background survival trio",
    "闹钟权限" to "Alarm permission",
    "收不到通知" to "Notifications not received",
    "耗电优化" to "Power optimization",
    "自启动" to "Autostart",
    "保活" to "Keep alive",
    "后台" to "Background",
    "杀后台" to "Background killed",
    "国产手机为省电喜欢「杀后台」，会导致主动问候 / 群聊收不到。设置里备好三个跳转按钮，逐一点击去系统里放行：" to "Chinese phones like to \"kill background processes\" to save power, which can stop proactive greetings / group chats from arriving. Settings provides three jump buttons; tap them one by one to grant permission in the system:",
    "三步设置" to "Three-step setup",
    "1. 🔋 电池优化白名单：把本应用设为「不允许优化 / 无限制」。" to "1. 🔋 Battery optimization allowlist: set this app to \"Don't optimize / Unrestricted\".",
    "2. 📱 厂商自启动管理：允许自启动、关联启动、后台活动。" to "2. 📱 Vendor autostart management: allow autostart, associated startup, and background activity.",
    "3. ⏰ 精确闹钟授权：允许设定提醒。" to "3. ⏰ Exact alarm authorization: allow setting reminders.",
    "把应用锁在最近任务卡片上（下拉加锁），并在系统通知设置里允许横幅与铃声。" to "Lock the app on the recent tasks card (pull down and tap the lock) and allow banners and ringtones in the system notification settings.",
    "还不行" to "Still not working",
    "BackgroundSurvivalHelper 跳转各 ROM 页面（电池优化白名单 / 厂商自启管理 / SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM 授权）；POST_NOTIFICATIONS 运行时权限在开启问候 / 群聊时即时请求（Tiramisu+）。" to "BackgroundSurvivalHelper jumps to each ROM's page (battery optimization allowlist / vendor autostart management / SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM authorization); the POST_NOTIFICATIONS runtime permission is requested immediately when greetings / group chats are enabled (Tiramisu+).",
    "群聊玩法" to "Group chat features",
    "提人" to "Mention someone",
    "自动聊天" to "Auto chat",
    "群" to "Group",
    "拉群" to "Start a group",
    "多人" to "Multiple people",
    "多角色" to "Multiple characters",
    "可以拉多个角色建一个群一起聊！新建群聊：选封面、起群名、勾选成员。" to "You can pull several characters into one group and chat together! To create a group chat: pick a cover, name the group, and check the members.",
    "输入 @ 可以点名某个角色回答，她一定回；其他成员也可能随机搭话（一条消息最多 4 名成员回复）。" to "Typing @ lets you call on a specific character to answer, and she will always reply; other members may also chime in at random (up to 4 members can reply to one message).",
    "@提人" to "@Mention",
    "设置 → 群聊 → 打开「空闲自动聊天」：你不说话时群里成员也会自己唠起来，偶尔还会向你提问；每天轮次可调。" to "Settings → Group chat → turn on \"Idle auto chat\": when you stay silent, the group members will chat among themselves and occasionally ask you questions; the daily round count is adjustable.",
    "群聊仅云端 AI 可用；正盯着群聊页面时通知不会打扰你。" to "Group chat is available only with cloud AI; while you are looking at the group chat page, notifications will not disturb you.",
    "GroupChatWorker：discuss 轮 DISCUSS_REPLIES_PER_ROUND=2 名成员接力互聊；每 ASK_USER_EVERY_N_ROUNDS(3) 轮改为 ask-user 轮向用户提问。用户回合 MAX_REPLIES_PER_USER_MESSAGE=4（@ 指定必答占额 + 随机补齐）；成员上限 10、人设截断、上下文限量；时段 09:00–22:00、用户发言后冷却；前台抑制通知。" to "GroupChatWorker: a discuss round has DISCUSS_REPLIES_PER_ROUND=2 members chatting in relay; every ASK_USER_EVERY_N_ROUNDS(3) rounds it switches to an ask-user round that asks the user a question. User turn: MAX_REPLIES_PER_USER_MESSAGE=4 (@-mentioned members always answer and take up a slot, the rest are filled randomly); member cap 10, persona truncation, context limits; time window 09:00–22:00, cooldown after the user speaks; notifications are suppressed in the foreground.",
