    "网易云" to "NetEase Cloud",
    "音乐页顶部搜索框可以在线搜歌：结果里点「添加」收进播放列表，随时播放。" to "The search box at the top of the music page lets you search songs online: tap \"Add\" on a result to put it in the playlist and play it anytime.",
    "「设置 → 音乐」顶部搜索框可以在线搜歌：结果里点「添加」收进播放列表，随时播放。" to "The search box at the top of Settings → Music lets you search songs online: tap \"Add\" on a result to put it in the playlist and play it anytime.",
    "音乐在后台持续播放，聊天、刷角色都不打断；角色视频出声时会自动让路暂停。" to "Music keeps playing in the background, and chatting or browsing characters does not interrupt it; when a character video plays sound, it automatically pauses to make way.",
    "全局播放" to "Global playback",
    "网易云接口搜索取外链 → ExoPlayer 流式播放；播放列表持久化（MUSIC_PLAYLIST，按 key 去重追加在线曲目）；与 Seedance 播放互斥降音（音频焦点协调）。" to "The NetEase Cloud API search returns external links → ExoPlayer streaming playback; the playlist is persisted (MUSIC_PLAYLIST, appending online tracks with key-based deduplication); it lowers the volume mutually exclusively with Seedance playback (audio focus coordination).",
