    "音乐页「导入本地音乐」可从手机里选歌（支持多选），导入后保存在应用内，完全离线可听。" to "\"Import local music\" on the music page lets you pick songs from your phone (multiple selection supported); imported songs are saved inside the app and can be played completely offline.",
    "「设置 → 音乐」点「导入本地音乐」可从手机里选歌（支持多选），导入后保存在应用内，完全离线可听。" to "In Settings → Music, tap \"Import local music\" to pick songs from your phone (multiple selection supported); imported songs are saved inside the app and can be played completely offline.",
    "点歌曲旁的 ♡ 收藏；用收藏过滤开关只看你喜欢的歌。" to "Tap the ♡ next to a song to favorite it; use the favorites filter toggle to see only the songs you like.",
    "收藏夹" to "Favorites",
    "SAF 多选 audio/* 拷贝至内部存储；favorites 为 stringSet 持久化；重复模式顺序 / 列表循环 / 单曲循环 + 独立 shuffle 开关。" to "SAF multi-select copies audio/* to internal storage; favorites is persisted as a stringSet; repeat modes are sequential / list loop / single loop plus an independent shuffle toggle.",
