    "播放器支持：随机 / 上一曲 / 播放暂停 / 下一曲 / 循环模式切换、进度条拖动、音量滑杆。" to "The player supports: shuffle / previous track / play-pause / next track / repeat mode switching, dragging the progress bar to seek, and a volume slider.",
    "有歌词的歌会逐行高亮自动滚动，当前句突出显示；本地导入的歌若无歌词则显示「暂无歌词」。" to "Songs with lyrics highlight line by line and scroll automatically, with the current line emphasized; locally imported songs without lyrics show \"No lyrics\".",
