    "想看角色「动起来」？聊天顶栏点 📹 开启自动视频：之后 AI 每次回复都会自动生成一段对应短视频插在消息里（需先配置服务）。" to "Want to see characters \"come alive\"? Tap 📹 in the chat top bar to turn on auto video: from then on, every AI reply automatically generates a matching short video inserted into the message (requires the service to be configured first).",
    "配置" to "Configuration",
    "设置 → Seedance 对话视频：填 API Key（官方方舟，或支持媒体协议的中转站）→ 点「测试连接」→ 保存。" to "Settings → Seedance conversation video: enter the API Key (official Ark, or a relay station that supports the media protocol) → tap \"Test connection\" → Save.",
    "「邂逅」页面：生成过的视频按时间排成竖滑流，可全屏播放、保存到手机。" to "The \"Encounters\" page: generated videos are arranged in a vertically scrolling feed by time, and can be played fullscreen or saved to your phone.",
    "看所有视频" to "See all videos",
    "视频卡上有状态说明，按提示操作即可；涉及扣费的重试会先弹确认。" to "Each video card shows a status note, so just follow the prompts; retries that incur charges show a confirmation first.",
    "失败了" to "Failed",
    "仅云端 AI 模式可用；生成需要排队，等待几分钟属正常。" to "Available only in cloud AI mode; generation is queued, so waiting a few minutes is normal.",
    "双协议自适应：官方 base（含 /api/v3）任务接口；中转站媒体协议 POST /v1/media/generate + GET /v1/media/status（URL 特征自动识别）。SeedanceVideoState 状态机分阶段给出对应重试动作，Worker 后台推进；Fast 变体分辨率受限；水印仅官方渠道生效；语音固定开启。" to "Dual-protocol adaptation: the official base (including /api/v3) task API; the relay station media protocol POST /v1/media/generate + GET /v1/media/status (auto-detected from URL patterns). The SeedanceVideoState state machine gives the matching retry action per stage, with a Worker advancing in the background; the Fast variant has a restricted resolution; the watermark applies only to the official channel; voice is always on.",
